<main id="top">
<div class="hero">
<div class="grid-bg" id="gb"></div><div class="glow"></div>
<div class="wrap">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow fade">Construction company · since 2008</div>
<h1><span class="ln"><span>Built to last.</span></span><span class="ln"><span>Delivered <em>on time.</em></span></span></h1>
<p class="lead fade">We build homes and commercial properties and handle full renovations, turnkey — with a fixed price, quality control at every stage and a 10-year warranty.</p>
<div class="cta fade"><a href="#contact" class="btn">Get a quote</a><a href="#services" class="btn ghost">Our services</a></div>
</div>
