<div class="stat"><b><span data-c="10">0</span> years</b><span>warranty on our work</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b><span data-c="98">0</span>%</b><span>projects delivered on time</span></div>
</div></div>
</div>

<div class="marq"><div id="mq"></div></div>

<section id="why"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow rv">Why us</div>
<h2 class="rv">We work so you never have to worry</h2>
<div class="adv">
<div class="card rv"><span class="n">01</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 4l16 6v12c0 11-7 18-16 22C15 40 8 33 8 22V10z"/><path d="M17 24l5 5 9-10"/></svg><h3>10-year warranty</h3><p>A written warranty in the contract covering all structural work and engineering systems.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:.1s"><span class="n">02</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><rect x="8" y="6" width="32" height="36"/><path d="M15 16h18M15 24h18M15 32h10"/></svg><h3>Fixed price</h3><p>The cost is locked into the contract. No hidden extras during construction.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:.2s"><span class="n">03</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18"/><path d="M24 12v12l8 6"/></svg><h3>Clear deadlines</h3><p>A work schedule with milestones and a penalty for delays caused by us.</p></div>
<div class="card rv" style="--d:.3s"><span class="n">04</span><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="16" r="8"/><path d="M8 42c0-9 7-15 16-15s16 6 16 15"/></svg><h3>In-house crews</h3><p>Salaried specialists and site supervision. You deal with one responsible manager.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="services" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
<div class="eyebrow rv">Services</div>
<h2 class="rv">Full cycle — from design to handover</h2>
<div class="svc">
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">01</span><h3>House construction</h3><div><p>Custom houses in aerated concrete, brick and timber frame — from foundation to final finishing, including design and permits.</p><div class="tags"><span>Design</span><span>Foundation</span><span>Turnkey</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Commercial properties</h3><div><p>Offices, warehouses, retail and production space. We work to the client’s schedule without stopping your business.</p><div class="tags"><span>Warehouses</span><span>Offices</span><span>Retail</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">03</span><h3>Major renovation</h3><div><p>Full re-layout, replacement of utilities, structural reinforcement and finishing of apartments, houses and offices.</p><div class="tags"><span>Re-layout</span><span>Utilities</span><span>Finishing</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">04</span><h3>Facades and roofing</h3><div><p>Insulation, ventilated facades, plastering and roof installation of any complexity, with a watertightness guarantee.</p><div class="tags"><span>Insulation</span><span>Roofing</span><span>Facades</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">05</span><h3>Engineering systems</h3><div><p>Heating, water supply, ventilation, electrics and low-voltage networks — design, installation and commissioning.</p><div class="tags"><span>Heating</span><span>Electrics</span><span>Ventilation</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
<div class="row rv"><span class="n">06</span><h3>Supervision and estimates</h3><div><p>Independent quality control, cost estimating and audits of other contractors’ sites. We can help when a project is going off plan.</p><div class="tags"><span>Estimates</span><span>Audit</span><span>Control</span></div></div><span class="ar">→</span></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="projects" class="hs" data-hs><div class="hs-pin">
<div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow rv">Projects</div><h2 class="rv">Projects we are proud of</h2></div>
<div class="hs-track" id="tk">
